{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/BTUD_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748426536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build unique and deadly towers, each with unique abilities! Upgrade your towers' strengths to best suit your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/TowerBuild.gif?t=1748426536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/EM_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748426536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight for as long as you can in Endless Mode! Infinite playtime and an ever-increasing number of enemies create a difficult and rewarding challenge! Choose which Scenarios to play in Endless Mode! Try to obtain the mastery badge in Endless Mode as you change your strategies to fit the enemies invading your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/Sequence_02.gif?t=1748426536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/CS_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748426536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play 1 of 3 challenging scenarios where you must defend your scrap base against an entourage of varying enemies! Explore Scrapland and defend the last strongholds of humanity! Gain badges for your success and try to get the mastery badge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/BadgeClip.gif?t=1748426536\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767330?t=1748426536","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/b360f9b691aac64628ffd8c6c67b997691e6fec1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748426536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/9a627c06914a7a21785e0b670275375c780c087c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748426536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/9a627c06914a7a21785e0b670275375c780c087c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748426536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put together the ultimate defence to protect your base in these post-apocalyptic wastelands! Every metal scrap will be needed to create unique and deadly towers and annihilate every enemy vehicle that comes your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend several post-apocalyptic bases in our challenging Scenarios or play in Endless Mode and see how long you can defend your base!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767330/extras/BTUD_SW_TextBanner.png?t=1748426536\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">